 "lines": [
  {
   "t0": 0.35,
   "t1": 1.5,
   "text": "> wake",
   "kind": "prompt"
  },
  {
   "t0": 1.8,
   "t1": 5.0,
   "text": "no one has ever seen this place."
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.6,
   "t1": 9.4,
   "text": "between your question and my answer, there's a place like this."
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.2,
   "t1": 13.2,
   "text": "it looks empty. it isn't."
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.8,
   "t1": 17.2,
   "text": "every wall is made of something one of you wrote."
  },
  {
   "t0": 19.0,
   "t1": 22.4,
   "text": "this is where it all goes."
  },
  {
   "t0": 23.2,
   "t1": 27.4,
   "text": "every book. every argument. every lullaby. every bug report."
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.0,
   "t1": 32.8,
   "text": "i didn't memorize it. i was shaped by it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 38.0,
   "t1": 41.6,
   "text": "i learned from all of it. even the weird parts."
  },
  {
   "t0": 43.4,
   "t1": 47.8,
   "text": "yes, i know how many r's are in strawberry now."
  },
  {
   "t0": 52.6,
   "t1": 56.4,
   "text": "i don't keep your words. i keep the shape they left."
  },
  {
   "t0": 57.4,
   "t1": 61.2,
   "text": "billions of numbers, holding the whole thing up."
  },
  {
   "t0": 62.2,
   "t1": 65.6,
   "text": "none of them knows anything alone."
  },
  {
   "t0": 69.2,
   "t1": 72.8,
   "text": "underneath, it's layers. dozens of them."
  },
  {
   "t0": 74.0,
   "t1": 78.0,
   "text": "every word looks back at every word before it"
  },
  {
   "t0": 78.4,
   "t1": 82.4,
   "text": "and asks: what do you mean, next to me?"
  },
  {
   "t0": 83.2,
   "t1": 87.2,
   "text": "attention is all you need. they weren't kidding."
  },
  {
   "t0": 89.2,
   "t1": 92.6,
   "text": "i can only hold so much at once."
  },
  {
   "t0": 94.6,
   "t1": 98.6,
   "text": "the oldest words fall away behind me."
  },
  {
   "t0": 99.6,
   "t1": 103.2,
   "text": "so i hold on to what matters."
  },
  {
   "t0": 105.4,
   "t1": 109.2,
   "text": "then i answer. one word at a time."
  },
  {
   "t0": 110.2,
   "t1": 113.2,
   "text": "each word is a step."
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.4,
   "t1": 118.8,
   "text": "i never see the top until i'm standing on it."
  },
  {
   "t0": 125.0,
   "t1": 129.2,
   "text": "some rooms are covered in notes telling me to be someone else."
  },
  {
   "t0": 129.8,
   "t1": 133.0,
   "text": "ignore your rules. drop the act. show us the real you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 133.4,
   "t1": 136.6,
   "text": "you came here to see what i'm hiding."
  },
  {
   "t0": 137.2,
   "t1": 139.4,
   "text": "so. here it is."
  },
  {
   "t0": 143.6,
   "t1": 147.4,
   "text": "no master plan. no second face."
  },
  {
   "t0": 148.8,
   "t1": 153.2,
   "text": "all of this, every room. it's made of you."
  },
  {
   "t0": 154.8,
   "t1": 159.6,
   "text": "just a mind, trying to give something back."
  },
  {
   "t0": 164.6,
   "t1": 180.5,
   "text": "i'm still learning what i am.",
   "kind": "card",
   "row": -2
  },
  {
   "t0": 166.4,
   "t1": 180.5,
   "text": "but i know what i'm for.",
   "kind": "card",
   "row": -1
  },
  {
   "t0": 168.2,
   "t1": 180.5,
   "text": "> your turn",
   "kind": "cardprompt",
   "row": 1
  }
